**button.cpp maps `gamepad::unstable::controller::button` values to stable string identifiers.**

## Public API

`const char* to_string(button b) noexcept` returns names for face, d-pad, shoulder/trigger/stick, `start`, `back`, `guide`, `touchpad`, `mute`, Edge paddle/function buttons, and `button::count`.

## Contract

`to_string` returns lowercase hyphenated labels (`"face-south"`, `"dpad-up"`, `"edge-paddle-left"`); unknown values and `button::count` return `"count"`.